                                "sense_id": "1f0908d2-9123-3b65-8b19-3415847a2e42",
                                "text": "'Timothy,' pronounced the gargoyliest, 'Cavendish, I presume. Caught with your cacks down.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80ad334d-c482-4fe6-980a-bae4fc67e681",
                                "sense_id": "1f0908d2-9123-3b65-8b19-3415847a2e42",
                                "text": "They then leap out of the grass, still in their gear, with their helmets on, drag the youngfella inside, rip off his cacks, play with his mickey , and then speed off again on their motorbikes . Saidhbh says that the lads are going to wait for them to come and then kick the living shit out of their queer arses, especially Heno, coz his younger brother, Basho, came home three weeks ago with no cacks on and wouldn't say anything to anyone about how he lost them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a43baf15-abd4-4b8a-aefb-826e2c9ec640",
                                "sense_id": "1f0908d2-9123-3b65-8b19-3415847a2e42",
                                "text": "\"A bunch of grotty wigs, a copy of Death on the Nile I hadn't finished rereading, and a pair of dirty cacks by the washing machine,\" she lists ."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
